    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper class for performant <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_range" kindref="compound">LiveRange</ref> bulk updates. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Calling <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_range_1a0b73c8d5ae32ca13dd02ddde86ffd0a2" kindref="member">LiveRange::addSegment()</ref> repeatedly can be expensive on large live ranges because segments after the insertion point may need to be shifted. The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_range_updater" kindref="compound">LiveRangeUpdater</ref> class can defer the shifting when adding many segments in order.</para>
<para>The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_range" kindref="compound">LiveRange</ref> will be in an invalid state until <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_live_range_updater_1a3743aaad6337d6a4c483f6c19efa3894" kindref="member">flush()</ref> is called. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
